<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE DEALS TO BE INSERTED ON FRIDAY MORNING.</title>
<headline>BOURSE DEALS TO BE INSERTED ON FRIDAY MORNING.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn bourse said on Thursday the deals which were agreed today but were not inserted because of the unexpected stoppage of trade, will be inserted into the bourse system on Friday between 0930-1000.</p>
<p>Trade on the bourse stopped around 1130 or 2.5 hours before usual on Thursday due to technical problems with its computer network, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
